# Launcher split, move L6 (docs/engine/modularization_plan.md, Part C sections 18 and 21): public profiles - the
# profile data and worker, my showcase on this device, the social-links table, badges (main.cpp 11774-11962 at the
# base) and the sample profile, the page's drawing helpers and DrawPublicProfilePage (12189-13266) ->
# launcher/PublicProfilePage.hpp / .cpp. The Account page's social-links editor stays in main.cpp.
# Check it with (on the move commit):
#   python3 scripts/check_pure_move.py --base HEAD~1 --head HEAD --source launcher/main.cpp \
#       --dest launcher/PublicProfilePage.hpp --dest launcher/PublicProfilePage.cpp --dest launcher/LauncherShared.hpp \
#       --rules docs/engine/moves/L6_public_profile_page.rules
# Moved unchanged into PublicProfilePage.hpp (main.cpp uses them): struct PfLocalShowcase, struct SocialPlatform with
# the kSocials table (constants), struct PfPageOut. Moved unchanged into LauncherShared.hpp: the accent presets table
# (struct AccentPreset, kAccentPresets: constants used by main.cpp and the profile page).
#
# main.cpp: `static` dropped on what the moved code uses; main.cpp's ten forward declarations of the multiplayer
# helpers (MpJoin ... MpPartyId) move to LauncherShared.hpp without `static`, and their definitions drop `static`.
